        <p class="entry-text"><strong>Ocorrências citadas:</strong> Pv 13.4; <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/PRO.15.19" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">15.19</a>; 19.15.</p>
