        <p class="entry-text"><strong>Ocorrências citadas inicialmente:</strong> 1Sm 22.22; <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/2MA.4.47" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">2Mc 4.47</a>; <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/2MA.13.4" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">13.4</a>; <a class="reference reference-link" href="https://www.die-bibel.de/en/bible/LXX/4MA.1.11" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">4Mc 1.11</a>; PSal 9.5.</p>
